        "text": "…………雛菜？",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "嗯～……？",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "在做什么？折纸……？",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "对～再等一下～……",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "好～，完成了♡是心形哦～！",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哦哦，折得真好。",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "啊哈～雛菜只会折这个哦～？",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "不过纸上的字透出来，不太可爱呢～",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "是拿什么东西的背面折的吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "这个～？学校发的讲义～～～",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "像进路调查那种！",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶，那个不是要交的吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "嗯～，是啊？",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "想着写什么好呢～，想着想着就变成心形了～♡",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不行吧，要交的东西折成这样……！",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "啊哈～，对吧～？",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……要好好写，在期限之前交上去哦？",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "嗯～，尽量会那样做！",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "不过是呢～……",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "雛菜才高一，就要写毕业之后的事～",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "……明明还超～远的呢？",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊……嗯。",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我学生的时候，好像也这么想过。",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "诶～那现在是不同了？",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "是啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "雛菜也许觉得还是以后的事，不过……",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "嘿～……",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那个，写好了的话，可以给我看看吗。",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "嗯～？可以是可以……",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "………………嘛，不过也是。",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "总有一天会结束的呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶……？",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "雛菜只要能一直开开心心、幸幸福福的，那样就好了～",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………雛菜。",
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "好好想一想吧。",
            "nextNodeId": "100"
          },
          {
            "label": "\"结束\"是指……",
            "nextNodeId": "120"
          },
          {
            "label": "一转眼就过去了哦。",
            "nextNodeId": "140"
          }
        ]
      },
      "100": {
        "id": "100",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这是雛菜自己的以后啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "101"
      },
      "101": {
        "id": "101",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "啊哈～制作人，好像老师哦。",
        "nextNodeId": "102"
      },
      "102": {
        "id": "102",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……雛菜。",
        "nextNodeId": "103"
      },
      "103": {
        "id": "103",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "好～雛菜会好好想的哦～？",
        "nextNodeId": "104"
      },
      "104": {
        "id": "104",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "老师♡"
      },
      "120": {
        "id": "120",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "诶～？",
        "nextNodeId": "121"
      },
      "121": {
        "id": "121",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "是说高中啊，三年就结束了呢～",
        "nextNodeId": "122"
      },
      "122": {
        "id": "122",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "123"
      },
      "123": {
        "id": "123",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "雛菜也总有一天，会不再是女高中生的呢～……",
        "nextNodeId": "124"
      },
      "124": {
        "id": "124",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "啊，不过也有三年结束不了的情况吧～！",
        "nextNodeId": "125"
      },
      "125": {
        "id": "125",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶，不，那可不行……！"
      },
      "140": {
        "id": "140",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "现在回头想想就是这样。至少我是。",
        "nextNodeId": "141"
      },
      "141": {
        "id": "141",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "嗯～……都说快乐的时间一转眼就过去呢～？",
        "nextNodeId": "142"
      },
      "142": {
        "id": "142",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "雛菜基本上一直都很开心，回过神来好多事都已经结束了～",
        "nextNodeId": "143"
      },
      "143": {
        "id": "143",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈，这样啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "144"
      },
      "144": {
        "id": "144",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "嗯～！啊哈～，今天一天也很开心！"
      }
    }
